  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "GGUF export now writes a companion Ollama Modelfile (TEMPLATE/stop sequences/num_ctx) derived from the checkpoint's own control-token metadata, fixing exported models producing incoherent output when run through Ollama with no prompt template. GgufModelExporter control tokens are now caller-configurable instead of hard-coded, and checkpoints containing NaN/Infinity are now rejected at export time instead of silently producing a corrupt GGUF. Added opt-in repetition-penalty sampling support (GenerationOptions.RepetitionPenalty) to the native text generator.",
  "verbatimVersion": "0.3.0",
